#. module: nme_invoicing
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_nme_invoicing
msgid ""
"=============================\n"
"Nusantara ERP - Invoicing\n"
"=============================\n"
"\n"
"Customer invoices, vendor bills, partial payments, overdue follow-up and\n"
"aging reports of Nusantara Mini ERP.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Features\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"* Customer invoices and vendor bills created from sales and purchase\n"
"  orders: goods are invoiced on the **delivered / received** quantity,\n"
"  services on the ordered quantity. Orders show the invoiced quantity and\n"
"  their invoicing status.\n"
"* **Numbering on posting**: drafts have no number; the ``no_gap`` sequences\n"
"  ``INV/`` and ``BILL/`` are only consumed when an invoice is posted, and a\n"
"  numbered invoice can be cancelled but never deleted.\n"
"* Due date from the payment terms, taxes per line (VAT 11% by default).\n"
"* **Partial payments** through the *Register Payment* wizard; payment state\n"
"  ``not_paid`` / ``partial`` / ``paid`` and amount due computed from the\n"
"  posted payments. An invoice can never be paid more than its total.\n"
"* Daily scheduled action flagging overdue invoices and creating an\n"
"  \"Overdue Invoice\" activity for the salesperson.\n"
"* **Aging report** (SQL view) of receivables and payables by bucket\n"
"  (not due, 1-30, 31-60, 61-90, over 90 days), always computed on the\n"
"  current date.\n"
"* The customer credit exposure of ``nme_sales`` is extended: the invoiced\n"
"  part of the orders is replaced by the amount still due on invoices.\n"
"* Printable invoice, email sending, mass posting from the list.\n"
"\n"
"Security\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"* *Invoicing / User*: creates and posts invoices, registers payments.\n"
"* *Invoicing / Manager*: cancels or resets posted invoices, cancels\n"
"  payments.\n"
"* Salespeople and buyers can read the invoices of the orders they can read\n"
"  (``access`` domain operator).\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"Author\n"
"------\n"
"\n"
"* M. Fadli Kurniawan\n"
"\n"
"License\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"LGPL-3\n"
msgstr ""
"=============================\n"
"Nusantara ERP - Penagihan\n"
"=============================\n"
"\n"
"Faktur pelanggan, tagihan pemasok, pembayaran sebagian, tindak lanjut\n"
"faktur lewat jatuh tempo, dan laporan umur Nusantara Mini ERP.\n"
"\n"
"**Daftar Isi**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Fitur\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"* Faktur pelanggan dan tagihan pemasok dibuat dari pesanan penjualan dan\n"
"  pesanan pembelian: barang difakturkan berdasarkan kuantitas yang\n"
"  **dikirim / diterima**, jasa berdasarkan kuantitas yang dipesan. Pesanan\n"
"  menampilkan kuantitas yang sudah difakturkan beserta status penagihannya.\n"
"* **Penomoran saat posting**: draf belum memiliki nomor; sequence ``no_gap``\n"
"  ``INV/`` dan ``BILL/`` hanya terpakai saat faktur diposting, dan faktur\n"
"  yang sudah bernomor dapat dibatalkan tetapi tidak pernah dapat dihapus.\n"
"* Jatuh tempo dari termin pembayaran, pajak per baris (PPN 11% secara default).\n"
"* **Pembayaran sebagian** melalui wizard *Catat Pembayaran*; status pembayaran\n"
"  ``not_paid`` / ``partial`` / ``paid`` dan sisa tagihan dihitung dari\n"
"  pembayaran yang terposting. Faktur tidak pernah dapat dibayar melebihi totalnya.\n"
"* Tindakan terjadwal harian yang menandai faktur lewat jatuh tempo dan membuat\n"
"  aktivitas \"Faktur Lewat Jatuh Tempo\" untuk penjual.\n"
"* **Laporan umur** (SQL view) piutang dan hutang per kelompok\n"
"  (belum jatuh tempo, 1-30, 31-60, 61-90, lebih dari 90 hari), selalu dihitung\n"
"  berdasarkan tanggal hari ini.\n"
"* Eksposur kredit pelanggan dari ``nme_sales`` diperluas: bagian pesanan yang\n"
"  sudah difakturkan diganti dengan sisa tagihan pada faktur.\n"
"* Faktur yang dapat dicetak, pengiriman email, posting massal dari tampilan daftar.\n"
"\n"
"Keamanan\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"* *Penagihan / Pengguna*: membuat dan memposting faktur, mencatat pembayaran.\n"
"* *Penagihan / Manajer*: membatalkan atau mengembalikan faktur terposting ke\n"
"  draf, membatalkan pembayaran.\n"
"* Penjual dan pembeli dapat membaca faktur dari pesanan yang dapat mereka baca\n"
"  (operator domain ``access``).\n"
"\n"
"Kredit\n"
"======\n"
"\n"
"Penulis\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"* M. Fadli Kurniawan\n"
"\n"
"Lisensi\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"LGPL-3\n"

